cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RSeQC-rust, please cite this repository. RSeQC-rust is an independent
  reimplementation of RSeQC; if your work relies on the underlying scientific methods RSeQC
  implements, please also cite the original RSeQC project (see "references" below).
title: RSeQC-rust
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-17"
authors:
  - name: Md Mobashir Rahman
# NOTE: this repository has not yet been published under a public URL -- see
# compatibility/divergences.yaml's DIV-0003 for why this project's own release license (and, by
# extension, a permanent citable URL) is still pending a decision. Update `repository-code` and
# `url` below once that happens; Cargo.toml's own `repository` field uses the same placeholder.
repository-code: "https://github.com/TBD/rseqc-rust"
url: "https://github.com/TBD/rseqc-rust"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
references:
  - type: software
    title: RSeQC
    authors:
      - name: Liguo Wang
      - name: RSeQC contributors
    repository-code: "https://github.com/liguowang/RSeQC"
    notes: >-
      The original RNA-seq quality-control toolkit this project reimplements. See that
      repository for the canonical citation for RSeQC itself (its own README/publication).
